# Your OpenRouter key and egress consent for this repository's drivers (run_batch.py, puzzle_solve.py,
# tournament.py, play-vs-llm.sh). `bash setup.sh` writes secrets.env for you; it is git-ignored.
#
# 1) Paste your key from https://openrouter.ai/keys after the = below (no quotes):
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# 2) Egress consent (REQUIRED). Every game ships the full board/hand state to
#    openrouter.ai. Holding a key is NOT consent — you must uncomment the next line
#    to opt in. The driver refuses to run until you do.
# OPENROUTER_ALLOW_EGRESS=1
